"""R3 weight table (market x family; alpha / protective / screen) and go/no-go register. Writes CSV + chart JSON.
Weight rules, in order: W1 a coordinator ruling decides where it speaks; W2 otherwise, if the panels agree, that value;
W3 otherwise the lower panel value unless lab data at QUANTGEN's net costs support the higher one (the gate cannot be loosened);
W4 a cell only one panel reviewed keeps that panel's value, flagged * (one-sided prior; it cannot feed any book until a card passes);
W5 cells no panel reviewed keep the prior, flagged n.r. Normalisation proposed for macro R-15: base_weight = w / 3, so no weight implies more than 1.0x.
"""
